# Artificial Evolution changes De-evolve's printed creature-type word Salamander to Elf. Because the Aura reads its own
# changed text (CR 612.2), the enchanted Memnite becomes an Elf instead, while keeping the -4/-0 and can't-block effects.

[Bot1 Deck]
De-evolve
Memnite
